<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascent Pediatrics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascent Pediatrics.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Ascent Pediatrics Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cowen was the lead underwriter of Ascent's May 30 intial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Ascent gained 3/8 to 9-3/8.</p>
</text>
